<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:39:11.900Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>REMOVE TABLE Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>Databases</keyword>
    <keyword>REMOVE TABLE command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">REMOVE TABLE Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">从当前数据库中删除一张表。该表将变为空闲表，或从磁盘中删除。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">REMOVE TABLE &lt;TableName&gt; [DELETE | RECYCLE]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;TableName&gt;<tab />当前数据库中表的名称。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">DELETE<tab />在将表从数据库中删除后，将其表文件（及其备忘录文件和索引文件）从磁盘中删除。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">RECYCLE<tab />旨在将文件移至“回收站”。此时，文件将被永久删除，与 DELETE 子句的效果相同。<text styleclass="Body Text" style="font-weight:bold; color:#ff0000;">目前 RECYCLE 尚未得到完全支持</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">如果不使用 DELETE 和 RECYCLE 子句，表文件将作为空表保留在磁盘上。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_ADD_TABLE">ADD TABLE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_RENAME_TABLE">RENAME TABLE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_DELETE_DATABASE">DELETE DATABASE</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
